{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 69,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.7423706054688,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "alone. Fekuda et al. evaluated the cost–effectiveness of concurrently using Xpert Ultra and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9369506835938,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "LF-LAM among people living with HIV and concluded that concurrent testing is the preferred",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        524.4124755859375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "cost-effective strategy. Previous cost–effectiveness analyses primarily focused on Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9918823242188,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "RIF or Xpert Ultra, leaving a gap in evidence regarding the other technologies that may meet",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        461.58038330078125,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the LC-aNAAT class criteria. For details of particular studies see  Web Annex B.9.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        524.0208740234375,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "In preparation for the GDG meeting in May 2024, WHO commissioned a study to assess the cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        526.9644165039062,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness of using LC-aNAATs (including Xpert Ultra, Truenat and other novel LC-aNAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.9688720703125,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "in the development pipeline) for the detection of TB when used concurrently among people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.9655151367188,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and children, including children with HIV, across two different country settings",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        526.9644775390625,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "(Malawi and the Philippines). An objective of the study was to assess the cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        526.9865112304688,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "of concurrent use of LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples and LF-LAM on urine for TB diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        526.9589233398438,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "and rifampicin-resistance detection among adult people living with HIV with presumptive TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66522216796875,
        384.2406921386719,
        276.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "compared with a single LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples alone.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        527.0250854492188,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "In the hypothetical model, a cohort of people living with HIV with signs and symptoms of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        527.0193481445312,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "progressed through a decision analytical framework. In the intervention arm, TB diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.8349609375,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "involved the concurrent use of LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples and LF-LAM on urine, whereas",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96168327331543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        526.9591064453125,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "the comparator arm exclusively used LC-aNAAT on respiratory specimens. The probability of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        526.991943359375,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "being able to provide a respiratory sample was considered, and testing was carried out, either",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        526.9683227539062,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "on both respiratory and urine samples concurrently or solely on urine. In both intervention",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        526.803955078125,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "and comparator arms, participants not diagnosed through the diagnostic strategy had the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        526.965576171875,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "opportunity for clinical diagnosis. People with bacteriologically confirmed TB underwent DST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.6690979003906,
        526.93701171875,
        424.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "for rifampicin and began either drug-susceptible TB or DR-TB treatment, depending on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.1690979003906,
        527.0331420898438,
        440.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "DST result. All individuals were followed over time, including those with false negative or false",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999300003051758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.6690979003906,
        526.973388671875,
        455.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "positive diagnostic results, to account for unnecessary treatment or additional mortality due",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.1690979003906,
        172.3623809814453,
        471.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "to missed diagnoses.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.1730041503906,
        526.9464111328125,
        495.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "The cost–effectiveness results of concurrent use of LC-aNAAT with LF-LAM among people living",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964693069458008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.6730041503906,
        527.0140991210938,
        510.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "with HIV, when used in the emblematic settings of Malawi and the Philippines, are shown",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.1729736328125,
        526.97998046875,
        526.3179931640625
      ],
      "text": "in Table 2.3.1.1 In Malawi, the average cost of implementing an LC-aNAAT on a respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.6729736328125,
        526.9688720703125,
        541.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "sample was US$ 276, with a corresponding average DALY of 2.44. When used concurrently",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.1729736328125,
        527.05908203125,
        557.3179931640625
      ],
      "text": "with LF-LAM, the average cost rose to US$ 298, while the average DALY decreased to 1.93. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982335090637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.6729736328125,
        526.9667358398438,
        572.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "resulting incremental cost per DALY averted was US$ 42, with a 95% uncertainty range (UR)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.1729736328125,
        526.9722290039062,
        588.3179931640625
      ],
      "text": "of US$ 18 to US$ 345. Similarly, in the Philippines, LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample had an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.6729736328125,
        526.9678955078125,
        603.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "average cost of US$ 220, with an average DALY of 2.78, whereas concurrent use with LF-LAM",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.1729736328125,
        526.958984375,
        619.3179931640625
      ],
      "text": "incurred an average cost of US$ 238 and an average DALY of 2.13. The incremental cost per",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.6729736328125,
        291.4820556640625,
        634.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "DALY averted was US$ 28 (95% UR: 12–249).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 53",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}